; DIAGNOSTIC preset for FTMO_Gold_CRT_QT.mq5 — NOT for live trading.
; Purpose: loosen the filters so you get MANY more trades to study the
; loss pattern (run in Strategy Tester with Visualization ON).
; Once you see what the losing trades look like, switch back to the
; normal FTMO_Gold_CRT_QT.set and apply the targeted fix.
